            { "text": "テーブル、ページ、コードユニット、拡張オブジェクトなど 13 種類に対応", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-tool-get-next-object-id", "locator": "Parameters", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "how-to-start",
          "heading": "使い始めるには",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "core",
          "items": [
            { "text": "VS Code の GitHub Copilot で、新しいオブジェクトの ID を自然言語で依頼する", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-tool-get-next-object-id", "locator": "Visual Studio Code examples", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "VS Code 以外では、AL MCP Server（altool launchmcpserver）から呼び出せる", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-agent-tools-overview", "locator": "Using the AL MCP Server", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "prerequisites-limits",
          "heading": "前提・制限",
          "availability": "present",
          "priority": "detail",
          "items": [
            { "text": "走査は構文のみで、インストール済みの依存アプリ内の ID は検出されない", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-tool-get-next-object-id", "locator": "冒頭", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] },
            { "text": "ID は予約されず、保存前に再度呼ぶと同じ ID が返る", "origin": "learn", "assertion": "fact", "verification": "verified", "evidence": [{ "url": "https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dynamics365/business-central/dev-itpro/developer/al-agent-tools/al-tool-get-next-object-id", "locator": "Important", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T00:00:00Z" }] }
          ]
        },
